 "remarks": "There is a rare kind of magic when classic architecture meets a modern, artistic eye. Privately tucked at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac in Tokeneke School District. This stunning six-bedroom center-hall Colonial is surrounded by extraordinary grounds reminiscent of a private botanical garden. Mature specimen trees, sculpted greenery, flowering perennials and winding bluestone pathways create a breathtaking landscape in every season. Inside, sophisticated interiors blend timeless elegance with modern style. Sun-filled rooms, oversized windows, bespoke finishes and designer outdoor lighting frame spectacular garden views throughout. A beautifully remodeled eat-in kitchen serves as the heart of the home, flowing effortlessly into gracious living and entertaining spaces. Outdoors, an infinity-edge gunite pool and spa take center stage, surrounded by expansive bluestone terraces for dining, lounging and entertaining. A dedicated fire pit gathering area adds another enchanting dimension to this remarkable setting. Lush, mature landscaping provides exceptional privacy, creating a true resort-like retreat. Steps from Five Mile River, Rowayton and coastal Darien, this extraordinary property offers the perfect marriage of classic architecture, sophisticated design and unforgettable indoor-outdoor living. An exceptional property with the added luxury of flexibility, offering generous possibilities for future expansion.",
